WEBVTT

00:00:01.340 --> 00:00:03.270
Dankichi! How's Nekota?!

00:00:03.270 --> 00:00:05.520
He's on top of his game!

00:00:05.520 --> 00:00:08.800
He actually brought that behemoth down to his knees!

00:00:09.490 --> 00:00:13.610
<i>Nekota's punches are as smooth and keen as a razor blade.</i>

00:00:13.610 --> 00:00:18.400
<i>If one hits a vital area, it can render a large man unconscious.</i>

00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:19.450
<i>But...</i>

00:00:19.450 --> 00:00:20.370
What round is it?

00:00:20.370 --> 00:00:21.840
The third round!

00:00:21.840 --> 00:00:23.490
<i>He's not out of gas.</i>

00:00:23.490 --> 00:00:25.710
<i>He can still maintain his focus.</i>

00:00:25.710 --> 00:00:26.960
<i>Nekota-san.</i>

00:00:26.960 --> 00:00:29.100
<i>Kamogawa was an unwanted surprise.</i>

00:00:29.100 --> 00:00:30.960
<i>But now that Yuki-san is here,</i>

00:00:31.450 --> 00:00:32.970
<i>I can move heaven and earth!</i>

00:00:35.330 --> 00:00:40.080
<i>Th-This nip is towering over a red-blooded American?</i>

00:00:40.730 --> 00:00:45.460
<i>His country lost, so he should be hanging his head to me!</i>

00:00:45.460 --> 00:00:47.950
<i>His kind will never triumph over America!</i>

00:00:48.700 --> 00:00:49.710
Look at that left!

00:00:49.710 --> 00:00:51.100
But he missed!

00:00:51.670 --> 00:00:54.880
Nekota's instincts are as good as it gets!

00:00:55.370 --> 00:00:57.880
<i>My head's crystal clear!</i>

00:00:57.880 --> 00:01:00.510
<i>I can see every punch as they come!</i>

00:01:00.510 --> 00:01:03.760
<i>Goddamn jap! Nip! Shovelteeth!</i>

00:01:06.680 --> 00:01:09.680
<i>Solid punches and a fierce attack.</i>

00:01:09.680 --> 00:01:12.710
<i>So this is the top speed of a lightweight boxer?!</i>

00:01:13.690 --> 00:01:16.150
Amazing! He's dodging every punch!

00:01:16.150 --> 00:01:19.940
He's just like those flying works of art that maneuvered through the air,

00:01:19.940 --> 00:01:22.860
the pride and joy of Japan, the Zero fighters!

00:01:23.450 --> 00:01:24.950
Can you mimic that, Kamogawa?

00:01:25.620 --> 00:01:28.450
He can't reach that guy's weak spots.

00:01:28.450 --> 00:01:32.710
So he simply goes under his left arm and makes him buckle over.

00:01:34.710 --> 00:01:37.210
That puts the weak spot right in front of him.

00:01:37.210 --> 00:01:39.460
Then he utilizes his lightning speed!

00:01:40.710 --> 00:01:43.770
That GI is not some dumb galoot either.

00:01:43.770 --> 00:01:46.470
Nekota is just a better natural fighter than him!

00:01:46.900 --> 00:01:51.350
We can never copy that! Only Nekota has that gift!

00:01:51.880 --> 00:01:54.150
<i>Hate to admit it, but I'm mesmerized.</i>

00:01:54.850 --> 00:01:55.400
<i>That's truly...</i>

00:01:56.760 --> 00:01:58.360
<i>a work of art!</i>

00:02:02.780 --> 00:02:04.680
Yew managed to get out alive.

00:02:07.120 --> 00:02:11.620
So yew finally came? I dragged out this fight just so yew could see it.

00:02:11.620 --> 00:02:13.360
G-Good luck!

00:02:13.360 --> 00:02:14.550
Yew can count on me.

00:02:14.550 --> 00:02:16.760
I'm putting out his lights in the next round.

00:02:16.760 --> 00:02:19.100
Quit flapping your gums and replenish your oxygen!

00:02:19.100 --> 00:02:20.700
You're sucking wind right now!

00:02:20.700 --> 00:02:22.630
Forgot yew brought along a heckler.

00:02:22.630 --> 00:02:24.180
Don't get full of yourself!

00:02:24.180 --> 00:02:25.730
He can take you out with one punch!

00:02:25.730 --> 00:02:27.190
If he does, it's all over!

00:02:27.190 --> 00:02:28.850
I get it! I get it!

00:02:29.280 --> 00:02:31.540
Tell me when it's about time to go in.

00:02:31.540 --> 00:02:32.890
R-Right.

00:02:33.500 --> 00:02:35.650
<i>I guess I was worried over nothing.</i>

00:02:36.370 --> 00:02:40.650
<i>Nobody who's punch drunk can work the ring like that.</i>

00:02:40.650 --> 00:02:42.420
Sarge, you all right?

00:02:42.420 --> 00:02:43.570
Will you calm down!

00:02:43.570 --> 00:02:45.740
I will win no matter what I face!

00:02:45.740 --> 00:02:48.660
Old Glory will not be spat on by one of them!

00:02:49.690 --> 00:02:52.690
America doesn't know the meaning of the word "defeat"!

00:02:55.260 --> 00:02:58.000
<i>That Japanese is clearly faster than our sergeant.</i>

00:02:59.130 --> 00:03:03.300
<i>The way it's going, he'll lose on points if not by a KO.</i>

00:03:04.460 --> 00:03:08.170
<i>He's wrongfully thinking he's fighting for America.</i>

00:03:08.170 --> 00:03:10.640
<i>His pride will not allow him to lose.</i>

00:03:11.260 --> 00:03:14.110
<i>He will stop at nothing to win.</i>

00:03:14.650 --> 00:03:18.310
<i>You better be careful, you brave Japanese.</i>

00:03:18.310 --> 00:03:19.500
Nekota!

00:03:20.070 --> 00:03:22.020
Hey, Nekota! The bell's about to ring!

00:03:22.990 --> 00:03:24.070
The bell?

00:03:24.910 --> 00:03:27.880
Oh... Oh, yeah.

00:03:27.880 --> 00:03:29.540
The bell's gonna ring?

00:03:30.030 --> 00:03:32.280
Something's gone wrong with Nekota.

00:03:32.280 --> 00:03:33.850
He was fast asleep out there.

00:03:39.710 --> 00:03:42.050
<i>His moves are fantastic.</i>

00:03:42.050 --> 00:03:46.220
<i>But sudden sleepiness is a classic sign of being punch drunk!</i>

00:03:47.470 --> 00:03:48.800
There goes Nekota!

00:03:51.870 --> 00:03:53.060
<i>There's no time!</i>

00:03:53.590 --> 00:03:56.560
<i>The flame's about to go out on my wick!</i>

00:03:56.560 --> 00:03:58.810
<i>I'll settle this fight...</i>

00:03:59.530 --> 00:04:01.060
<i>while I'm still conscious!</i>

00:04:02.390 --> 00:04:03.320
Don't rush it!

00:04:03.320 --> 00:04:05.230
Tire out your opponent first!

00:04:05.230 --> 00:04:07.440
He's trying to end it quick, why?

00:04:07.440 --> 00:04:09.070
<i>There's no time!</i>

00:04:14.490 --> 00:04:15.540
Is he going down?!

00:04:16.080 --> 00:04:18.200
<i>I won't go down!</i>

00:04:18.200 --> 00:04:21.760
<i>I will not lose to some jap!</i>

00:04:21.760 --> 00:04:22.710
<i>Got 'im!</i>

00:04:22.710 --> 00:04:25.080
<i>No matter what!</i>

00:04:26.710 --> 00:04:28.470
<i>That was a huge swing.</i>

00:04:28.470 --> 00:04:30.220
<i>No matter what!</i>

00:04:37.680 --> 00:04:38.650
Yew...

00:04:39.600 --> 00:04:40.740
bastard!

00:04:44.960 --> 00:04:46.730
A rabbit punch?!

00:04:46.730 --> 00:04:49.250
Huh, a rabbit what?

00:04:49.250 --> 00:04:53.490
A punch to the back of the head that can damage the spinal cord.

00:04:54.180 --> 00:04:58.750
It's a very illegal punch that can easily lead to brain injuries.

00:04:58.750 --> 00:05:01.250
I know he did that on purpose!

00:05:02.050 --> 00:05:05.380
He just threw away whatever pride he had as a boxer.

00:05:05.380 --> 00:05:07.560
He's fighting a jap.

00:05:07.560 --> 00:05:09.920
He'll win by any means if he has to.

00:05:09.920 --> 00:05:12.760
He's fighting to protect America's honor.

00:05:12.760 --> 00:05:13.910
That's a foul!

00:05:13.910 --> 00:05:15.010
This may be bad!

00:05:16.230 --> 00:05:19.270
<i>A hit to the back of the head can easily lead to brain damage.</i>

00:05:19.270 --> 00:05:23.060
<i>And if the guy's already brain damaged to begin with...</i>

00:05:23.060 --> 00:05:24.770
<i>He might be...</i>

00:05:24.770 --> 00:05:26.240
Nekota! You okay?!

00:05:26.240 --> 00:05:28.030
It's me? Can you hear me, Nekota?!

00:05:28.030 --> 00:05:31.280
That's enough! You've done good! Now stop this!

00:05:33.280 --> 00:05:36.280
<i>Nekota!</i>

00:05:36.920 --> 00:05:38.610
<i>What did he say?</i>

00:05:39.140 --> 00:05:40.160
<i>Stop?</i>

00:05:41.280 --> 00:05:43.580
<i>Yer talking nonsense.</i>

00:05:44.660 --> 00:05:46.920
Don't stand up! Stop right now!

00:05:47.600 --> 00:05:55.050
<i>I will prove who's the better fighter, then return back home to the mountains.</i>

00:05:55.050 --> 00:05:57.680
Nekota!

00:05:57.700 --> 00:06:00.680
<i>Yes... the sooner the better.</i>

00:06:01.540 --> 00:06:05.810
<i>If I don't, then Kamogawa will find out...</i>

00:06:06.440 --> 00:06:08.440
<i>that my symptoms began...</i>

00:06:10.050 --> 00:06:11.940
<i>way back then.</i>

00:06:13.000 --> 00:06:16.250
<i>That was a fight fought fair and square.</i>

00:06:17.220 --> 00:06:20.050
<i>I don't want yew to feel that yew owe me anything.</i>

00:06:21.360 --> 00:06:23.760
<i>Yew owe me nothing.</i>

00:06:23.760 --> 00:06:26.160
<i>I will raise up out of here.</i>

00:06:27.090 --> 00:06:30.000
<i>Kamogawa... you will...</i>

00:06:31.560 --> 00:06:35.970
<i>keep on going on... as a Japanese boxer!</i>

00:06:39.220 --> 00:06:40.470
<i>Yuki-san?</i>

00:06:41.050 --> 00:06:44.000
<i>Yuki-san... Yuki-san...</i>

00:06:44.860 --> 00:06:46.730
<i>My darling Yuki-san...</i>

00:06:47.850 --> 00:06:51.110
<i>Will you come home with me?</i>

00:06:51.110 --> 00:06:53.740
<i>It does get boring out in the mountains.</i>

00:06:54.560 --> 00:06:56.850
<i>Yeah, I'll get a dog.</i>

00:06:57.650 --> 00:07:01.050
<i>A big ol'... white dog.</i>

00:07:01.050 --> 00:07:04.040
<i>Me... and Yuki-san...</i>

00:07:05.620 --> 00:07:09.390
<i>will certainly... have a ball.</i>

00:07:09.390 --> 00:07:10.200
Nekota!

00:07:10.200 --> 00:07:10.960
Nekota-san!

00:07:18.020 --> 00:07:20.130
Referee, stop the fight! Stop it now!

00:07:20.130 --> 00:07:21.510
But he's still standing!

00:07:29.900 --> 00:07:31.070
Somebody stop him!

00:07:31.520 --> 00:07:33.030
Stop! Please stop!

00:07:33.490 --> 00:07:35.070
Outta the way, jap!

00:07:35.430 --> 00:07:36.150
Nekota?!

00:07:38.910 --> 00:07:39.950
Nekota!

00:07:42.160 --> 00:07:44.410
Nekota!

00:07:50.150 --> 00:07:53.540
Even Nekota couldn't beat him.

00:07:55.130 --> 00:07:56.910
We can't win...

00:07:57.510 --> 00:07:59.970
We can't win against America!

00:07:59.970 --> 00:08:01.890
Do you get it now, you nipponese?!

00:08:02.620 --> 00:08:06.290
Your kind will never win against America, no matter what!

00:08:06.290 --> 00:08:10.900
Just keep walking before us with your heads facing the ground, jappies!

00:08:12.060 --> 00:08:14.010
Asshole!

00:08:14.010 --> 00:08:15.450
He's got my attention!

00:08:16.400 --> 00:08:18.950
Go patch up Nekota's injuries!

00:08:18.950 --> 00:08:20.460
Kamogawa-san?

00:08:20.460 --> 00:08:21.320
What did he say?

00:08:22.580 --> 00:08:26.200
Japan still has a pair of fists that can clobber you!

00:08:26.200 --> 00:08:28.630
I still have these fists!

00:08:32.570 --> 00:08:34.430
He's in critical condition.

00:08:35.140 --> 00:08:38.620
We don't know when he'll wake up from his coma.

00:08:39.390 --> 00:08:45.770
Even if he does wake up, he may remain handicapped in some way.

00:08:46.520 --> 00:08:49.460
Dammit! This went on before the match?

00:08:49.460 --> 00:08:52.150
Why did he go into the ring without telling us?!

00:08:54.300 --> 00:08:56.200
<i>I wouldn't say anything either.</i>

00:08:56.990 --> 00:09:00.140
<i>My pride as a boxer wouldn't allow it, 
especially if I were pitied.</i>

00:09:01.620 --> 00:09:03.010
<i>But above all else...</i>

00:09:03.640 --> 00:09:08.500
<i>if the one who first damaged me was my best friend... I'd never say a word to him!</i>

00:09:10.890 --> 00:09:12.650
<i>Was it ever since our fight?</i>

00:09:13.910 --> 00:09:17.240
<i>Your silence told me everything I needed to know.</i>

00:09:18.890 --> 00:09:21.640
<i>You've been fighting your battles all alone.</i>

00:09:22.860 --> 00:09:25.550
<i>You're one helluva boxer.</i>

00:09:26.550 --> 00:09:28.710
<i>You have my deepest respect.</i>

00:09:30.300 --> 00:09:32.930
<i>But I guess we'll never fight again.</i>

00:09:34.490 --> 00:09:36.280
<i>That makes me sad.</i>

00:09:38.170 --> 00:09:39.710
<i>Rest up good.</i>

00:09:40.580 --> 00:09:42.970
<i>Sleep for as long as you like.</i>

00:09:43.750 --> 00:09:48.270
<i>When you wake up, you'll have no regrets.</i>

00:09:50.000 --> 00:09:53.250
<i>I will take revenge for you!</i>

00:10:10.420 --> 00:10:12.270
Enough with this crazy training!

00:10:12.270 --> 00:10:15.120
His face twisted with pain each time Nekota punched him.

00:10:15.120 --> 00:10:17.100
He has a weak torso.

00:10:17.100 --> 00:10:18.750
You'll break your bones!

00:10:18.750 --> 00:10:21.110
You can't fight a match with shattered fists!

00:10:21.110 --> 00:10:24.260
Then those fists weren't strong enough anyways!

00:10:24.860 --> 00:10:28.660
I don't have Nekota's reflexes or his instincts.

00:10:29.210 --> 00:10:33.960
If I end up trading punches with that huge guy, 
I'll only end up on the mat.

00:10:33.960 --> 00:10:34.870
I'm going...

00:10:34.870 --> 00:10:36.670
for one hit!

00:10:36.670 --> 00:10:39.630
I have to build up fists that can take him out with one punch!

00:10:40.630 --> 00:10:42.510
<i>This is insanity.</i>

00:10:43.020 --> 00:10:46.380
<i>But Kamogawa's weapon is that determination of his.</i>

00:10:47.590 --> 00:10:53.140
<i>That iron will is what keeps Kamogawa Genji, the boxer, going!</i>

00:10:55.760 --> 00:10:57.370
Are you training, sir?

00:10:57.370 --> 00:10:59.230
It <i>has</i>  been a while.

00:10:59.760 --> 00:11:02.480
Nekota's body blows hit home.

00:11:03.180 --> 00:11:05.590
He's seen what they've done, so he'll go for them!

00:11:08.140 --> 00:11:10.320
<i>His sweat is saying everything.</i>

00:11:10.320 --> 00:11:11.840
<i>He's serious about this.</i>

00:11:13.010 --> 00:11:16.110
<i>Before the war, he was fifth in the world welterweights.</i>

00:11:16.110 --> 00:11:18.520
<i>He was an excellent, upward-looking boxer.</i>

00:11:19.420 --> 00:11:23.860
<i>If it weren't for the war, he'd be sitting at the top right now.</i>

00:11:24.480 --> 00:11:27.610
<i>He's just another one of its victims.</i>

00:11:28.700 --> 00:11:31.830
<i>He's trying to return to his former self.</i>

00:11:31.830 --> 00:11:34.770
<i>He now respects the bravery of those Japanese.</i>

00:11:35.350 --> 00:11:40.060
<i>But he's already exposed a chink in his armor.</i>

00:11:41.360 --> 00:11:42.520
No way...

00:11:43.240 --> 00:11:46.070
He did this without a hammer?

00:11:47.080 --> 00:11:49.830
He only used his fists?

00:11:50.510 --> 00:11:54.870
If that's a fact, then Kamogawa's fists are made of iron.

00:11:55.370 --> 00:11:57.380
His iron will has created...

00:11:58.380 --> 00:11:59.540
iron fists!

00:12:02.310 --> 00:12:04.090
Well, I'm leaving.

00:12:06.310 --> 00:12:07.660
I'm sorry.

00:12:08.530 --> 00:12:10.960
I'm staying here with Nekota-san.

00:12:12.040 --> 00:12:15.840
Nekota-san said he'd give me strength.

00:12:17.060 --> 00:12:20.400
He fought a match he said he would fight.

00:12:21.210 --> 00:12:23.230
I want to be there when he wakes up.

00:12:31.610 --> 00:12:32.700
Sure.

00:12:35.350 --> 00:12:38.660
Kamogawa-san, I... I...

00:12:41.480 --> 00:12:43.120
Stay with him.

00:12:44.220 --> 00:12:45.380
Now and forever.

00:12:54.310 --> 00:12:55.930
<i>When I get into a ring,</i>

00:12:56.500 --> 00:12:59.350
<i>I always feel my body heat rising.</i>

00:13:00.200 --> 00:13:02.230
<i>Especially when I fought Nekota.</i>

00:13:03.840 --> 00:13:06.500
<i>But now my sweat's running real cold.</i>

00:13:07.440 --> 00:13:09.240
<i>I'm not even excited in the least.</i>

00:13:10.060 --> 00:13:11.530
Are you ready?

00:13:12.780 --> 00:13:15.530
<i>Are you feeling scared?</i>

00:13:16.080 --> 00:13:17.770
<i>Jackass.</i>

00:13:17.770 --> 00:13:21.830
<i>Compared to Nekota who went in there fearing he was punch drunk,</i>

00:13:21.830 --> 00:13:24.340
<i>this is not even a drop in the bucket.</i>

00:13:25.040 --> 00:13:26.460
Dankichi!

00:13:26.460 --> 00:13:27.760
Slap me!

00:13:27.760 --> 00:13:29.660
Light a fire in my belly!

00:13:29.660 --> 00:13:30.760
A fire?

00:13:30.760 --> 00:13:31.810
Hurry up, dammit!

00:13:31.810 --> 00:13:33.180
Fine!

00:13:33.730 --> 00:13:35.600
Bite on that bullet!

00:13:38.180 --> 00:13:41.100
I-I felt that!

00:13:41.100 --> 00:13:42.350
All right!

00:13:43.260 --> 00:13:44.850
Time to punch his lights out!

00:13:46.230 --> 00:13:48.770
Kamogawa! What kept you?!

00:13:48.770 --> 00:13:50.680
Get revenge for Nekota!

00:13:50.680 --> 00:13:52.860
Hit him with your Japanese spirit!

00:13:52.860 --> 00:13:56.510
Are we clear? Size him up before you go swinging.

00:13:56.510 --> 00:13:58.510
But he's just a dirty jap!

00:13:58.510 --> 00:13:59.500
Sarge.

00:14:01.160 --> 00:14:02.460
Fine.

00:14:02.460 --> 00:14:06.130
I'll listen to you since you agreed to be my second.

00:14:06.130 --> 00:14:10.510
Look at those abs! He's made them hard as boulders!

00:14:11.490 --> 00:14:13.470
Then I'll just sledgehammer those boulders!

00:14:13.470 --> 00:14:16.170
<i>Good, he's not nervous.</i>

00:14:16.170 --> 00:14:18.760
<i>All's left is to put your fists to work.</i>

00:14:18.760 --> 00:14:21.770
<i>Those iron fists!</i>

00:14:25.940 --> 00:14:27.250
<i>What the?</i>

00:14:27.250 --> 00:14:31.280
<i>He's not using his small build to quickly dart around?</i>

00:14:31.280 --> 00:14:35.780
<i>Is he sitting in one place waiting for me to trade fists?</i>

00:14:36.990 --> 00:14:40.410
<i>He's mocking me. I'm murdering his ass!</i>

00:14:42.470 --> 00:14:44.710
<i>I hate to admit it, but he's better in every respect!</i>

00:14:45.200 --> 00:14:46.960
<i>I can't drag this fight out!</i>

00:14:46.960 --> 00:14:51.050
<i>I kept banging on that log so I could end this in one blow!</i>

00:14:51.630 --> 00:14:54.260
<i>Both his ribs... and organs...</i>

00:14:54.260 --> 00:14:56.870
<i>will be crushed with this one blow!</i>

00:14:59.260 --> 00:15:00.010
Did that get him?

00:15:06.020 --> 00:15:09.660
<i>It's a good thing I listened to Miguel.</i>

00:15:09.660 --> 00:15:11.650
<i>That really shook me.</i>

00:15:13.350 --> 00:15:17.080
<i>I can feel the pain all the way to the marrow.</i>

00:15:17.080 --> 00:15:20.410
<i>I didn't feel the damn gloves when he hit me.</i>

00:15:20.410 --> 00:15:25.160
<i>That fist was packing something extremely hard.</i>

00:15:25.160 --> 00:15:28.420
<i>I've never felt a punch like that.</i>

00:15:28.830 --> 00:15:31.800
<i>What an intensely powerful punch!</i>

00:15:31.800 --> 00:15:34.170
That's Kamogawa's fist for you!

00:15:34.170 --> 00:15:36.670
<i>I will hit you again and again.</i>

00:15:36.670 --> 00:15:40.180
<i>Until one of these fists hits your torso!</i>

00:15:42.930 --> 00:15:45.910
What are you doing? Don't move!

00:15:46.880 --> 00:15:49.600
K-Kamogawa's...

00:15:52.450 --> 00:15:55.530
fighting... him!

00:15:56.240 --> 00:15:58.570
<i>He heard what he said.</i>

00:15:58.570 --> 00:16:00.810
H-He can't... win.

00:16:01.940 --> 00:16:03.890
H-He doesn't have...

00:16:07.230 --> 00:16:08.630
Take me.

00:16:09.830 --> 00:16:13.340
Take me... to the fight!

00:16:15.590 --> 00:16:17.470
Kamogawa!

00:16:19.430 --> 00:16:22.650
<i>Come on. Let's dance.</i>

00:16:22.650 --> 00:16:25.220
I know all your moves.

00:16:25.220 --> 00:16:26.360
<i>It's no use.</i>

00:16:26.360 --> 00:16:30.350
<i>Thanks to that second, he's not letting any punches land!</i>

00:16:30.800 --> 00:16:33.710
<i>His power and speed are certainly impressive.</i>

00:16:33.710 --> 00:16:35.650
<i>But that's all he has.</i>

00:16:35.650 --> 00:16:39.650
<i>He doesn't have Nekota's bobbing and weaving or explosive attacks.</i>

00:16:40.280 --> 00:16:43.160
<i>All he’s going for are direct body blows.</i>

00:16:43.160 --> 00:16:46.450
Sarge! Move to the side and use your left!

00:16:50.530 --> 00:16:54.360
<i>That's an excellent mix of logic and technique.</i>

00:16:54.360 --> 00:16:57.170
<i>No amount of spirit can match that.</i>

00:16:57.170 --> 00:17:00.630
<i>Is American boxing this unbeatable?</i>

00:17:00.630 --> 00:17:02.390
Dammit!

00:17:03.680 --> 00:17:06.970
<i>None of my punches... are connecting.</i>

00:17:08.640 --> 00:17:12.600
<i>It's like he's waltzing right into my counters.</i>

00:17:14.190 --> 00:17:17.360
<i>I know I can't fight like Nekota.</i>

00:17:17.360 --> 00:17:18.880
<i>Kamogawa...</i>

00:17:19.880 --> 00:17:23.110
<i>But I have to fight my own fight.</i>

00:17:23.110 --> 00:17:25.990
<i>I have to plow ahead forward!</i>

00:17:36.500 --> 00:17:37.670
How...

00:17:39.430 --> 00:17:41.330
How many times did I fall?

00:17:41.330 --> 00:17:42.960
I don't know.

00:17:42.960 --> 00:17:46.260
Anyway, let's call it quits.

00:17:46.260 --> 00:17:48.130
He'll beat you into a pulp.

00:17:48.130 --> 00:17:50.510
You'll be sharing a hospital room with Nekota.

00:17:51.060 --> 00:17:53.390
It's no use going on!

00:17:53.390 --> 00:17:55.760
He's simply bigger than you!

00:17:55.760 --> 00:17:57.940
This is in no way a fair fight!

00:17:58.550 --> 00:18:02.070
There's no gain in continuing with this pointless grudgematch!

00:18:03.670 --> 00:18:05.050
Gain?

00:18:06.690 --> 00:18:08.580
That's not what this is about.

00:18:08.580 --> 00:18:10.760
It's not?

00:18:10.760 --> 00:18:14.120
Then what the hell are you fighting for?

00:18:14.120 --> 00:18:16.520
That's the bell. Get lost!

00:18:16.520 --> 00:18:17.290
Hey!

00:18:19.500 --> 00:18:20.970
<i>What am I fighting for?</i>

00:18:22.250 --> 00:18:24.300
<i>What the hell am I fighting for?</i>

00:18:26.300 --> 00:18:27.540
He's down again!

00:18:27.540 --> 00:18:28.910
He'll get killed!

00:18:28.910 --> 00:18:31.680
Second, stop the match!

00:18:34.210 --> 00:18:36.190
<i>He's still going to stand?</i>

00:18:36.680 --> 00:18:38.570
<i>Is he a kamikaze?</i>

00:18:38.570 --> 00:18:41.840
<i>There’s nothing scarier than a Japanese fighting for a cause.</i>

00:18:42.570 --> 00:18:48.700
<i>We need to go for a huge offensive in order to minimize the damage.</i>

00:18:49.230 --> 00:18:52.700
<i>Just like what we did to force an end to that war.</i>

00:18:53.710 --> 00:18:55.810
What round just ended?

00:18:55.810 --> 00:18:58.800
We do the same things over again, so I couldn't keep track.

00:18:58.800 --> 00:19:00.710
We're heading into the seventh round.

00:19:01.440 --> 00:19:04.840
<i>I can’t believe he took a beating for 18 full minutes.</i>

00:19:05.340 --> 00:19:09.600
<i>His mind must be just as tough as his body.</i>

00:19:10.060 --> 00:19:14.000
<i>I never cease to be amazed at the Japanese fighting spirit.</i>

00:19:14.000 --> 00:19:17.240
<i>But, we're doing this for his sake as well.</i>

00:19:17.940 --> 00:19:19.010
Listen.

00:19:19.610 --> 00:19:22.060
He's got a low stance.

00:19:22.060 --> 00:19:24.860
So when the chance comes, strike down with your right.

00:19:26.590 --> 00:19:29.620
A chopping right? Not bad.

00:19:29.620 --> 00:19:31.660
Take him out of his misery.

00:19:32.710 --> 00:19:37.370
<i>What... the hell... am I fighting for-</i>

00:19:37.370 --> 00:19:39.810
Are we clear? This is the seventh round.

00:19:39.810 --> 00:19:40.950
Yeah.

00:19:41.460 --> 00:19:43.810
Only four rounds left, huh?

00:19:44.390 --> 00:19:48.090
Well... gotta knock him out...

00:19:48.430 --> 00:19:50.030
if I wanna win.

00:19:50.680 --> 00:19:51.850
Gotta knock him out.
